+foa/core.hpp and foa/table.hpp (compared with boost-1.91.0)
+include/emilib/emihmap4.hpp from line 91, whose HashMap adapts Boost's table
+throughout: the hash mixing (mulx.hpp); the group metadata, probing, lookup,
+insertion, erase, allocation, load limit and growth (core.hpp); and the
+iterator (table.hpp).
